                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] Experienced on the Oculus Rift with Touch Controllers [/h1]\n\nThis is about a 3-4 minute experience. It's a music VR video. It's very trippy and has a psychedelic kaledeiscope feel. The music fits what you're seeing. You can control some of the beats. At times if you press trigger or grab while touching balls there will be a sound for each ... just like IRL.\n\nIs it worth $1.99? Well, if you like this type of music or visuals then yes. If you don't, this probably won't change your mind. I say support the arts!",
